 r←FetchFromIndex(space folder);status;mat;ind;files;names;cmd;result;rc;msg;project
⍝ Fetch file(s) from the index that have been modified (or deleted) from the working area.\\
⍝ Files that are not APL source are offered as well; they are listed by their path.
 r←'Working area is clean, nothing can be brought back from the index'
 project←folder
 :If 0<≢space                       ⍝ The space identifies the project best when we have it
     project←⍕space
 :EndIf
 :If 0<≢status←Status project
 :AndIf 0<≢status←(status[;2]∊'MD')⌿status
     files←(⊃∘⌽∘HandleRenames)¨status[;3]   ⍝ For a rename Git reports "old -> new"
     names←status[;4]{0=≢⍺:⍵ ⋄ ⍺}¨files     ⍝ <Status> has already established the APL names
     mat←names,⍪{('(Modified)' '(Deleted)')['MD'⍳⍵]}status[;2]
     ind←'SelectFilesToRestore@Select files from the working area you want to restore from the index:' 1 CommTools.Select↓⍕mat
     :If ¯1≡ind
     :OrIf 0=≢ind
         r←'Cancelled by user'
     :Else
         cmd←'restore --worktree ',⊃,/{' '∊⍵:' "',⍵,'"' ⋄ ' ',⍵}¨files[ind]
         (rc msg result)←folder U.RunGitCommand cmd
         (cmd,⊃,/((⎕UCS 13),¨⊆msg))Assert 0=rc
         r←⍪(⊂'*** Restored from the index:'),mat[ind;1]
     :EndIf
 :EndIf
